TI  - Pre-crime, Post-criminology, and the Captivity of Ultramodern Desire
PY  - 2020
T2  - International Journal for the Semiotics of Law
VL  - 33
IS  - 2
SP  - 497
EP  - 514
DO  - 10.1007/s11196-020-09719-4
